== Trivia ==

* Trolls are usually named after the first thing they eat, but mountain trolls have no names. This could imply that they were simply never named, or possibly indicates that the first thing they tried to eat was another troll. More likely however, is that they have names lore-wise but are not shown ingame as so to avoid needing to create lots of variants of the same monster.
